{%- comment -%}
  snippets/kj-collection-url.liquid

  Echoes a URL that is guaranteed to resolve:
    the collection named by `handle`, if it exists;
    otherwise the one named by `fallback`;
    otherwise the all-products collection.

  Use it anywhere a hardcoded /collections/<handle> would otherwise be
  a link to a Shopify 404. The brand strip and the brand directory both
  list every house the shop carries, but a house only has a collection
  once someone creates it — 52 of 60 brand handles did not exist, so
  most of those links were dead. This resolves at render time, so each
  link starts working by itself the moment its collection appears.

  Usage:
    {%- capture url -%}
      {%- render 'kj-collection-url', handle: 'ladies-alkaram', fallback: 'ladies-unstitched' -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign target = collections[handle]
  if target.id
    echo target.url
  else
    assign alt = collections[fallback]
    if alt.id
      echo alt.url
    else
      echo routes.all_products_collection_url
    endif
  endif
-%}
